# AI SaaS Productivity Platform

An enterprise-grade AI-powered productivity platform that helps individuals and teams manage tasks, projects, calendars, meetings, and workflows using intelligent automation and AI assistance.

## Tech Stack

- **Backend:** Django, Django REST Framework
- **Frontend:** Next.js, React, TypeScript
- **Database:** PostgreSQL
- **Cache:** Redis
- **AI:** OpenAI / Gemini APIs
- **Deployment:** Docker, GitHub Actions

## Planned Features

- AI Task Assistant
- Smart Prioritization
- Calendar & Kanban Board
- Team Collaboration
- Productivity Analytics
- Time Tracking
- JWT Authentication
- REST APIs
- Stripe Billing
- Docker Deployment

